<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-KAFELNIKOV WINS GERMAN GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KAFELNIKOV WINS GERMAN GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>HALLE, Germany 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the $875,000 German grass-court men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Petr Korda (Czech Republic) 7-6 (7-2) 6-7 (5-7) 7-6 (9-7).</p>
</text>
